{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117350","id":4061613116,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7yF0w8","number":117350,"title":"Skeleton3D editor gizmos in the wrong place when using modifiers","user":{"login":"Y-o-p","id":33079174,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMDc5MTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33079174?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p","html_url":"https://github.com/Y-o-p","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Y-o-p/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-12T01:58:17Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T09:18:28Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.6.1 and 4.7.dev2\n\nReproducible in #114752 Skeleton3D usability PR. Not a regression AFAIK.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot 4.6.1 - Ubuntu 24.04.3 LTS - AMD Ryzen 7 5700X3D 8-Core Processor - Radeon RX 7800 XT - Vulkan 1.4.305 Forward+\n\n### Issue description\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1372\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47d4e834-b718-46da-9fe2-f67ad9b72bd0\" />\n\n<img width=\"709\" height=\"642\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2e6b389c-f8c6-42c2-8514-7a1dff5a25e5\" />\n\nIf you have a Skeleton3D modifier that is acting on a skeleton, trying to edit the Skeleton3D's bones shows the original pose rather than the final pose. I would expect to see the final pose so that you can tweak bones that aren't directly controlled by the modifier. In this example, I have an arm rig with a TwoBoneIK3D. You can see that the gizmo editing works as expected. The gizmo is just in the wrong place.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a Skeleton3D\n2. Add a TwoBoneIK3D, target, and pole\n3. Setup the constraint\n4. Edit the target and pole to be in a non default pose\n5. Try editing the Skeleton3D\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[4-7-dev-2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/25922754/4-7-dev-2.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117350/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}